<title>PORTUGAL: Port conditions update - Azores - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Azores - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PONTA DELGADA, Dec 31 - A number of containers have been removed from the sea bottom inside Ponta Delga harbour basin. According to local harbourmaster's report the port is now open to vessels with a 9-metre draught.</p>
</text>
